  m_text: "<b>Moon</b>  Lv 1  <color=#7A6A50>Crafting and processing.</color>\r\n  <color=#2F5E4E>0/30 XP</color>\r\n\r\n<b>Sun</b>  Lv 1  <color=#7A6A50>Selling and trade.</color>\r\n  <color=#2F5E4E>0/30 XP</color>\r\n\r\n<b>Earth</b>  Lv 1  <color=#7A6A50>Gathering.</color>\r\n  <color=#2F5E4E>0/30 XP</color>\r\n\r\n<color=#7A6A50>Moon raises product quality. Sun adds customers. Earth adds herbs.</color>\r\n"
