  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=22><b>FROM LAST WEEK</b></size>

    Your first week. At the end of each week, you leave a note here for yourself.



    <size=22><b>FIRST STEPS  2/10</b></size>

    <link="step:0"><color=#7A6A50><b>[ ]</b></color></link>  Give each day a goal

    <link="step:1"><color=#2F6B4F><b>[x]</b></color></link>  Choose products to sell

    <link="step:2"><color=#2F6B4F><b>[x]</b></color></link>  Share your gold into the three jars

    <link="step:3"><color=#7A6A50><b>[ ]</b></color></link>  Buy herbs at the market or the guild

    <link="step:4"><color=#7A6A50><b>[ ]</b></color></link>  Make your first product

    <link="step:5"><color=#7A6A50><b>[ ]</b></color></link>  Dry fresh herbs on the rack

    <link="step:6"><color=#7A6A50><b>[ ]</b></color></link>  Fill the shelf and open the shop

    <link="step:7"><color=#7A6A50><b>[ ]</b></color></link>  Gather wild herbs at the City Outskirt

    <link="step:8"><color=#7A6A50><b>[ ]</b></color></link>  Finish a commission for the town

    <link="step:9"><color=#7A6A50><b>[ ]</b></color></link>  Pay at least the minimum at month end

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 11f0434a02233bb4c96efbb51bf54d73, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 5687235179978430714, guid: 11f0434a02233bb4c96efbb51bf54d73, type: 2}
