  m_text: "<b>Home and Shop</b>  24 hours\r\n  <color=#7A6A50>open every day  |  walk 0 min</color>\r\n<b>Market</b>  7:00 - 17:00\r\n  <color=#7A6A50>closed Friday  |  walk 30 min</color>\r\n<b>Guild Hall</b>  8:00 - 16:00\r\n  <color=#7A6A50>closed Sunday  |  walk 45 min</color>\r\n<b>City Outskirt</b>  6:00 - 18:00\r\n  <color=#7A6A50>open every day  |  walk 60 min</color>\r\n\r\n<b>Every week</b>\r\n  New commissions at the guild  <color=#7A6A50>Monday</color>\r\n  Living costs paid at week end  <color=#A33B2E>-40</color>\r\n\r\n<b>Month end</b>\r\n  Debt payment, minimum  <color=#A33B2E>450</color>\r\n  Utilities  <color=#A33B2E>120</color>\r\n"
